{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/42046-recruiting-for-an-exalted-earth-game","id":42046,"title":"Recruiting for an Exalted Earth game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-03T17:15:19-08:00","id":42046,"title":"Recruiting for an Exalted Earth game","content":"If anyone plays on OpenRPG, I'm trying to get a game of Exalted going on Unshaped. It'll run Fridays about 8:00 pm eastern time to midnight eastern time (gah, I wish they would just lose Daylight Savings Time already). The setting itself draws inspiration from Modern Exalted and even uses some of the rules from Shards, but is set on Earth in modern times.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T12:24:25-08:00","id":44360,"title":"","content":"Voice chat based, text based, or a PbP organized through OpenRPG? What house rules, exalted types and what general tone/story are you going for?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T12:34:04-08:00","id":44367,"title":"","content":"OpenRPG is text based chat. I don't have much in the way of House Rules at the moment (still working an Astrology hack, and more may come when I reidentify all the problems of the system; I haven't run Exalted in years), but Firearms, drive, and the Resonance rules from shards are all in place. The only Exalt types I'm keeping off the table are Infernals and Alchemicals for plot reasons. As for general tone/story, it is a relatively optimistic &quot;fix the world&quot; kind of story. How much this turns into a variation of the Primordial War will ultimately be up to the players. I have a starting plot seed, but have found with Exalted its typically better to give a compass and a general direction than to try and lay railroad tracks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T14:40:51-08:00","id":44446,"title":"","content":"Hm, I'm game. Modern Alchemicals? Otherwise I think I'll go with an Infernal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Aretii: &quot;As one of the players described it, 'After initiation, it was actually a relief seeing who had eyepatches or bandaged hands - you know what <i>they</i> sacrificed, instead of wondering what bits people cut out of their own souls to gain power.'&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"